{
 "asset": "area_position_pattern_table",
 "about": "Where tactical battle units stand, relative to the map's PosPivot. The battle camera sits on the world -Z side looking +Z, so the teams face each other along X: players 3 m to the left facing +X, enemies 3 m to the right facing -X, spread in depth. Sets are picked by list position: players with 1-3 units in front (sets 0-2), enemies likewise (3-5). The Arena's tactical battle asks for the pattern PatternPVP (a name in the client's code); it uses the same positions.",
