   "source": "jdr-research",
   "doc": "docs/research/11-battle-and-positions.md",
   "note": "which fields the tactical battle reads, and the values that would zero damage or crash"
  },
  {
   "source": "jdr-default",
   "note": "the pattern name and positions are ours (no pattern names exist in the player's files)"
  },
  {
